WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.419
David Attenborough:
Join us for Prehistoric Planet
2.

00:00:02.461 --> 00:00:03.253
(Roar)

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:04.129
(Roar!)

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:10.886
♪♪

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:17.309
David Attenborough:
Sixty-six million years ago,
planet Earth was ruled by dinosaurs.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:21.730
David Attenborough:
Both majestic and extraordinary.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:28.612
David Attenborough:
The mysteries of their lives
have been largely undiscovered.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:31.823
David Attenborough:
Until now.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.242
♪♪

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:35.702
(Roars)

00:00:36.578 --> 00:01:04.481
♪♪

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:07.985
David Attenborough:
Join us for a journey like no
other.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.530
David Attenborough:
Where there is always more to
experience.

00:01:12.531 --> 00:01:14.032
David Attenborough:
And more to discover.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.492
♪♪

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.619
David Attenborough:
Explore five new worlds,

00:01:17.661 --> 00:01:19.121
♪♪

00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:20.580
David Attenborough:
filled with danger-

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.207
♪♪

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:23.417
David Attenborough:
-and adventure.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:29.381
♪♪

00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:30.465
(Roar)

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:31.883
(Roar!)

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:34.428
♪♪

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:37.014
David Attenborough:
This is Prehistoric Planet 2.

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:41.810
♪♪

